    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970409.0021\n\nSINGAPORE, April 9 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nNoon rubber prices\n\n\n\n\nWednesday's noon rubber prices in Singapore cents per kilo provided by the Singapore Commodity Exchange:\n\nBuyers   Sellers\n\nInt 2 RSS May        169.00    170.00 Nominal (N)\n\nInt 3 RSS May        169.00    170.00 N\nInt 4 RSS May        163.75    164.75 N\nInt 5 RSS May        160.00    161.00 N\nNo. 1 Air Dried Sheet    189.00    191.00 N\n\nInt 1X Thin Pale Crepe    234.50    238.50 N\n\nInt 1 Thin Pale Crepe    228.50    232.50 N\n\nInt 2 Thin Pale Crepe    220.50    222.50 N\n\nInt 3 Thin Pale Crepe    215.50    217.50 N\n\nInt 2 Thin Brown Crepe    132.00    134.00 N\n\nInt 3 Thin Brown Crepe    130.00    132.00 N\n\nInt 4 Thin Brown Crepe    128.00    130.00 N\n\nSSR/SMR 20 May        163.00    165.00 N\n\nJune       164.00    166.00 N SSR 50   May 161.00    163.00 N\nJune       162.00    164.00 N",
